      "content": "thanks. those are a good start for general stuff, but i need to be more specific for the study. i'm trying to differentiate between people from different neighborhoods to see if there are unique \"street\" or urban behavioral traits. like, could you give me some more targeted questions that look for markers of hyper-vigilance, specific ways of communicating/slang usage, or maybe even tendencies toward impulsive aggression that are often associated with those high-risk areas? i need to make sure the survey actually picks up on those specific cultural/environmental patterns.",
